  "note": "Election of the Donaghadee Urban Council, polled Monday 15 January 1923 (Belfast News-Letter, 17 January 1923, p. 6). Nineteen candidates for twelve seats; 841 of the 1,208 electors went to the poll. Only four members of the old council were re-elected."
